  "bio": "Mike Riveley is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in the intricate and vibrant Japanese style of tattooing. His studio, located at 1819 Woodbridge Ave in Edison, NJ, operates on an appointment-only basis, ensuring that each client receives his undivided attention and a professionally tailored experience. To book a session with Mike, you can contact him directly through his Instagram handle @mike_riveley, or reach out to the studio @vvxtattoos to witness his expert craftsmanship firsthand.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\n327 Main St. Metuchen NJ call or text 732 770 9886\n@mike_riveley @brentcarpentier @willtorrestattoos  @gracef.tattoo",
